lemma Antibes (a:f ≤ s)(b:s ≤ u): ∃ W:ChartY Y i k P_, W.Roll u=Z∧ W.Mark u=M∧VoyageQ F p (G'.trans a) W u hu:=by
 induction b using Nat.decreasingInduction with
 | self=> let V:= DockQ u Z M; exact ⟨V, (by simp [V,DockQ]), (by simp [V,DockQ]),⟨fun {_} a b=>by omega,fun {s} a b=>by obtain rfl:s=u:= Nat.le_antisymm b a; exact Zc,fun {_} a b=>by omega,fun {_} a b=>by omega ⟩⟩ -- tune
 | of_succ s b ih=>
    have b':=lt_of_lt_of_le b hu; have y:j≤ s:=G'.trans a
    obtain ⟨V,pU,uV,qV⟩:=ih (Nat.le_succ_of_le a); obtain ⟨χ,pχ⟩:= ParentJ s F p g0 a b' y V (qV.tandem le_rfl b) -- tune implicit b cast.
    let U:ChartY Y i k P_:={V with Br:=Function.update V.Br s χ}; let P0:= RollK p U s b'; let D':ChartY Y i k P_:={U with Mark:=Function.update U.Mark s P0}; let Γ:= F.FrescoBJ p s (f:=s) le_rfl b' y D'; let H:ChartY Y i k P_:={ D' with Roll:=Function.update D'.Roll s Γ }
    have h1(s₁:ℕ)(e:s < s₁): H.Mark s₁=V.Mark s₁:=Function.update_of_ne e.ne' ..; have h2(s₁:ℕ)(e:s < s₁): H.Br s₁=V.Br s₁:=Function.update_of_ne e.ne' ..; have h3(s₁:ℕ)(e:s < s₁): H.Roll s₁= V.Roll s₁:=Function.update_of_ne e.ne' ..
    have h_B:H.Roll s= F.FrescoBJ p s le_rfl b' y H:=Function.update_self ..
    have gT:F.DayGate p s y b' (H.Roll (s+1)) (H.Br s):=by rw[h3 _ (Nat.lt_succ_self _),show H.Br s=χ from Function.update_self ..]; exact pχ
    refine ⟨H,(h3 _ b).trans pU,(h1 _ b).trans uV,⟨?_,?_,?_,?_⟩⟩
    · intro s' x e; obtain p|pX:= lt_or_eq_of_le x; swap; · subst s'; exact gT
      rw [h3 (s'+1) (p.trans (Nat.lt_succ_self _)),h2 s' p]; exact qV.turn p e
    · intro s' x e; obtain p₁|pX:= lt_or_eq_of_le x; swap
      · subst s'; exact PayFloor s F p g0 H b' G' a gT h_B
      have h:= qV.tandem (s:=s') p₁ e; unfold CountWise at *; rw [h3 _ p₁]; exact h
    · intro s' x e; obtain x'|pX:= lt_or_eq_of_le x; swap; · subst s'; exact h_B
      rw [h3 _ x', qV.book (s:=s') x' e]; simp_rw[FrescoBJ,h2 _ x']
    intro s' x e; obtain x'|pX:= lt_or_eq_of_le x; swap
    · subst s'; rw [show H.Mark s=P0 from Function.update_self ..]; unfold P0 RollK; rw[h1 (s+1) (Nat.lt_succ_self _)]
    rw [h1 _ x', qV.lay (s:=s') x' e]; unfold RollK; rw[h1 _ (x'.trans (Nat.lt_succ_self _)),h2 _ x']
#print axioms Antibes
